かけたネスレかどこかのカプセル入れるやつそこそこ良かったです お試し的なの借りてきてわざと総務のデスクの近くに置いとくのオススメ","ts":"1622373611.425300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"d553"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3f975690-c350-48ca-9e02-cf6d650ec10f","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"それは社内の色々な手続きがあまりにもアレなので。。。","ts":"1622373501.425200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"w3C0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d8a23adc-9e95-42b4-a589-925092d5460a","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"ちゃんとメンテと補充にきてくれるの契約したほうが安上りそうだね","ts":"1622373344.424700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"XMRF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3b52fa36-2ddf-4347-b851-3a6b8731b606","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"自販機でコーヒー買ってるので手に入るけど、チームでコーヒーメーカーをカンパする？って話が上がっている","ts":"1622372984.423800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"thTk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"79ce379d-6c7a-454a-90cc-6f801a00574c","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"食後は必ずコーヒー飲むんですけど、先月から社食の出口にあったセブンイレブンが消滅して悲しみ","ts":"1622372937.423700","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"gunnyari","count":2,"users":["U9S4G0LJW","US90LD360"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HTIVr"}]},{"client_msg_id":"57b1ea18-7de6-4d07-9a0d-7f7e6d0f3baa","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"ラッシーも手軽に作れていいですね","ts":"1622372900.423600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vsTQh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"28500290-610c-45b0-aaf8-5a3c4da66bd0","type":"message","user":"U76GA7MFA","text":"あと、コーヒーや牛乳とかだと歯を磨きたくなる。","ts":"1622372527.423300","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":2,"users":["U9S4G0LJW","UFHQ7TNT0"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"yWUFf"}]},{"client_msg_id":"21b12b80-087f-4e13-a997-149b8eb7c01c","type":"message","user":"U76GA7MFA","text":"一杯だったら大丈夫。二杯目でNG。何か食べながらなら大丈夫みたい。","ts":"1622372432.422700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cqRf"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fec61cb8-81a2-44ed-a1a5-32c4f2adf5bc","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"コーヒーで腹下したことはないけど胃は痛くなる","ts":"1622372386.422000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5+l"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2f8a1f58-afff-4842-b98a-823e0241cfc8","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"素のコーヒーはそこまで下さないかなあ","ts":"1622372376.421800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tPV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b6967b0e-2b87-4a89-bcaa-35378565c278","type":"message","user":"U76GA7MFA","text":"僕はコーヒーを飲むと腹を下すので緑茶がメインです。水出しもおいしい。","ts":"1622372360.421400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"CW0p"}]},{"client_msg_id":"75e9ec57-f587-41a8-8241-f4e87a9dbd20","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"大人というか、10歳くらいから下るんだっけ?","ts":"1622372355.421300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"D2pDt"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a6d09392-744f-417f-bf10-6a8ffd38aaaa","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"まあ昔からそこそこ緩くなるのはあったけど、気にしてなかったんだろうな。","ts":"1622372314.420300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"aLJQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2c226b39-373a-460e-a436-7e665b580a85","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"大人はとくに、ある時期から乳糖耐性が下っていくので、それを補えてないと維持できないらしいので、それかなあと。","ts":"1622372296.419700","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"hee","count":2,"users":["U9S4G0LJW","U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"99r68"}]},{"client_msg_id":"757493e9-b7ff-4422-90dd-76292c35615a","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"へぇー、後天的に変わるもんなんですね","ts":"1622372224.418500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8y6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a627ee88-fff4-4286-9f67-b005e729ed0c","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"まったくだめってわけじゃなくて、ある時期はやたらとってた。\nが、ぱったり取らなくなったら乳糖の分解がわるくなったらしく、下す度が上ってしまった。","ts":"1622372200.418100","edited":{"user":"UAZ33BKV2","ts":"1622372252.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5Rrm"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c1d58629-eb09-4ddd-ac78-e63de702022c","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"牛乳だめな人か、つらそう","ts":"1622372154.417100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cfNg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"32cfe423-629b-412e-b7f4-31c964b8fd13","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"理由は単純で、\n• コーヒー系だけだとちょっと飽きた\n• コーヒーポーション+牛乳のやつだと腹を下しやすい\n• だけど健康を考えると、水分と乳系での整腸もしたい\nで、ヨーグルト+牛乳のラッシーになりました。\nあと暑い時期にむかってるので、それ対策でもある。","ts":"1622372130.416900","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":2,"users":["U9S4G0LJW","U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"PIirO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"16a3f381-6d92-4064-8f16-387fb2ee1b69","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"ラッシーいつかどこかで飲んだことあるけど美味しかったな","ts":"1622371870.414800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"opFGv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ca0f586f-b7e7-4ff6-81ef-865fd1b86446","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"最近、ラッシーをよく作って飲んでます","ts":"1622371526.414300","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"yosasou","count":4,"users":["U9S4G0LJW","UD1FQV38V","U01BY3SDBRS","U01D9BALEKU"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":fa